  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After several earthly calamities Hu Immortal suffered losses but gained new wood path dao marks and earth path dao marks. With those marks the blessed land’s environment was remodeled so she could plant stronger grasses and flowers than at the start.",
      "chapters": [
        826
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fairy_bai_hu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "General dao marks and attainment levels are covered on dao marks and attainment.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_dao_marks"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Minimen are born with wood path dao marks. Places where they live have vegetation growing rapidly, and with generational inheritances they are the race most skilled at growing plants and flowers.",
      "chapters": [
        871
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "minimen-vegetation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "race_minimen"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "If wood path resources stay in a blessed land and attract a wood path tribulation, the immortal aperture’s wood path dao marks increase. There are losses, but the aperture environment becomes even more ideal for wood path cultivation. Moving wood path resources out can instead draw a fire path tribulation whose fire path dao marks spoil the returned plants.",
      "chapters": [
        939
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "keeping-wood-resources",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Myriad tribulations around Spectral Soul carve space path, poison path, qi path, and wood path dao marks on his body to destroy his soul path dao marks. Those carved marks are not weaker than the soul path foundation he accumulated over a hundred thousand years.",
      "chapters": [
        1017
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rival-marks-on-spectral-soul",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_myriad_tribulation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Earthly calamities such as the wind flowers and spring dawn jade orioles gave Fang Yuan wood path and wind path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1161
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "calamity-gained-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_earthly_calamity",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Each leaf, branch, and root of the acupuncture tree is a Gu material rich in fire path and wood path dao marks.",
      "chapters": [
        1778
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fire-and-wood-materials",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After Divine Emperor City’s myriad life spring lightning explodes, the remaining wood path dao marks stay in the area and modify the battlefield gradually.",
      "chapters": [
        2175
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-residue",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "house_divine_emperor_city"
      ]
    }
